# @DISPLAY@ @VERSION@ — macOS

**ES** · Filtro de audio para **OBS Studio 28 o posterior** en **macOS 11+**, universal (**Apple Silicon e Intel**). Gratis y de código abierto, hecho con cariño por Streamerdesk — https://streamerdesk.com

**EN** · Audio filter for **OBS Studio 28 or later** on **macOS 11+**, universal (**Apple Silicon and Intel**). Free and open source, lovingly made by Streamerdesk — https://streamerdesk.com

## Instalar (español)
1. Cierra OBS Studio.
2. Haz doble clic en **`Instalar - Install.command`** (la primera vez: clic derecho > Abrir, mira abajo).
3. Abre OBS, clic derecho en tu micrófono > **Filtros** > **+** > **@NAME_ES@**.

Instalación manual: copia `@ID@.plugin` a `~/Library/Application Support/obs-studio/plugins/` (en el Finder: Ir > Ir a la carpeta…).
Tus presets de usuario viven en `~/Library/Application Support/obs-studio/plugin_config/@ID@/presets.json` y se conservan al actualizar o desinstalar.
Desinstalar: borra `@ID@.plugin` de esa carpeta de plugins.

## Install (English)
1. Quit OBS Studio.
2. Double-click **`Instalar - Install.command`** (first time: right-click > Open, see below).
3. Open OBS, right-click your microphone > **Filters** > **+** > **@NAME_EN@** (shown with its Spanish/English label).

Manual install: copy `@ID@.plugin` to `~/Library/Application Support/obs-studio/plugins/` (Finder: Go > Go to Folder…).
Your user presets live in `~/Library/Application Support/obs-studio/plugin_config/@ID@/presets.json` and are kept when updating or uninstalling.
Uninstall: delete `@ID@.plugin` from that plugins folder.

@GATEKEEPER@

